OL,3,GNEWSACould power to rent empty shops
OL,4,Ahelp high streets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew funding and powers to allow
OL,7,Fcouncils to fill empty high street
OL,8,Fshops could make a big difference, a
OL,9,FCornish MP has said.
OL,11,FThe government has allocated #10m for
OL,12,Flocal authorities to run rental
OL,13,Fauctions on shop units which have been
OL,14,Fvacant for more than a year.
OL,16,FNoah Law, Labour MP for St Austell and
OL,17,FNewquay, said it could be a "powerful
OL,18,Ftool" in efforts to rejuvenate town
OL,19,Fcentres.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
