OL,3,GNEWSACould power to rent empty shops
OL,4,Ahelp high streets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a town councillor has warned
OL,7,Fthe scheme is limited in its scope as
OL,8,Fit only applies to empty units for rent
OL,9,Fand not those for sale.
